('GSI25J01-005', 'v9.6_backfill_founder_approved', '', 'ADIA', 'Platinum Lily B 2024 RSC Limited (wholly owned ADIA subsidiary)', 'Yinson Production Offshore USD 1bn RCPS + 10% warrants (closing reported June 2025)', 'Multi-regional (assets not verified)', 'United Kingdom', 'United Kingdom', '', 'United Arab Emirates', 'GULF_OUTBOUND_PRIMARY_GROWTH_EQUITY', 'PRIVATE_FUNDING_ROUND_PREFERRED_SHARES_AND_WARRANTS', 'COMPLETED_CLOSING_REPORTED_2025_06_17_FIRST_TRANCHE_USD300M_FUNDED', 'RETAIN_PROVISIONAL_TRANSACTION', 'TARGET_DOMICILE_PRIMARY_OR_ENTITY_EVIDENCE', '', 'ADIA_AMOUNT_NOT_DISCLOSED_USD1BN_IS_ROUND_HEADLINE', 'B', '2025-01-14', '', 'https://www.yinson-production.com/news/yinson-production-secures-usd-1-billion-investment-from-consortium-of-international-investment-firms-to-drive-further-growth/', 'https://www.oedigital.com/news/526947-yinson-production-closes-1b-investment-to-drive-further-growth', '', 'Find the exact closing date and ADIA ticket; confirm no Jan 2025 row under another name.', '2026-11-14', '', '', 'TARGETED_NOT_EXHAUSTIVE', 'Backfill approved by founder 14 Nov 2026 and loaded as a new versioned row; v9.5 unchanged. Company release read in full (14 Jan 2025): consortium of ADIA subsidiary, BCI funds and RRJ; USD 1bn RCPS at USD 3.7bn post-money, optional further USD 500m. Closing article 17 Jun 2025: USD 300m first tranche, USD 700m called in up to 3 instalments by Dec 2026. ADIA-specific amount not disclosed; USD 1bn is the round. No Yinson row found in v9.5 master: one record, announcement and completion together, belongs in Jan 2025. RE-CHECKED 14 Nov 2026: OE Digital closing article read: definitive agreement signed 14 Jan 2025, closing reported 17 Jun 2025, USD 300m first tranche (USD 200m of it a special distribution to Yinson), USD 700m in up to three instalments by Dec 2026, optional further USD 500m within 24 months. Investors named: a wholly owned ADIA subsidiary (not named in that article), BCI funds and RRJ. ADIA amount and stake NOT disclosed. Master v9.5 has no Yinson record. Filing in January at signing is consistent with the ruling. FOUNDER DECISION 14 Nov 2026: approved as a Jan 2025 backfill. Awaiting load into the database by the founder; not loaded.', '2025', '2025', '2025', '', '', '', 'USD', '', '', 'PROVISIONAL_TRANSACTION', '', '', '2026-11-14', 'GULF_GLOBAL', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'COMPLETED_CLOSING_REPORTED_2025_06_17_FIRST_TRANCHE_USD300M_FUNDED', '', '', '', 'Yinson Production Offshore USD 1bn RCPS + 10% warrants (closing reported June 2025)', 'https://www.yinson-production.com/news/yinson-production-secures-usd-1-billion-investment-from-consortium-of-international-investment-firms-to-drive-further-growth/', 'COMPLETED_CLOSING_REPORTED_2025_06_17_FIRST_TRANCHE_USD300M_FUNDED', 'FIRST_TRANCHE_USD300M_FUNDED_ALL_INVESTORS_ADIA_SHARE_UNDISCLOSED', '', '', 'PROVISIONAL', '', 'ADIA_AMOUNT_NOT_DISCLOSED_USD1BN_IS_ROUND_HEADLINE', '2026-11-14', '', '', 'ADIA amount and stake undisclosed; exact closing date not found.', 'v9.6'),
